@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix foundation: <http://foundation.local/ontology/> .

# =============================================================================
# InspectorWidget
# =============================================================================
# Widget that displays detailed information about a class or instance
#
# Version: 0.1.0
# License: GNU GPL
# =============================================================================

foundation:InspectorWidget a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Widget ;
    rdfs:label "Inspector Widget" ;
    rdfs:comment "Widget that displays detailed information about a class or instance, including hierarchy, properties, relationships, and values" ;
    foundation:icon "info" ;
    foundation:canDisplay owl:Thing ;
    rdfs:seeAlso """
Examples:
- Inspector showing foundation:ThisUser with all properties
- Inspector displaying foundation:Person class hierarchy
- Inspector revealing all relationships of an Organization instance

Parameters:
- entity_id (required): The IRI of the class or instance to inspect

Can display: ANY concept or instance (owl:Thing)
""" .
